      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-16 06:42:25",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Today's the day 🔥 The Roadster unveil is tonight, and the FAA just locked down the sky over SpaceX's McGregor site from this morning through Oct 31, ground to 5,000 ft within 1.5 nautical miles, with SpaceX as the point of contact.\n\nA 16-day closure tells you tonight's show is only the beginning of what's being tested out there.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "teslayoda",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2000259921309278210/hkktXghC_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-14 22:53:11",
