        "text": "Rockstar Games posted its GTA 6 promo on YouTube and 𝕏. Just 90 minutes later:\n\n𝕏: 7.5 million views\nYouTube: 1.6 million views\n\nNearly 4.7 times as many reported views on 𝕏.",
