        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 2622,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUskWArXkAAoqY9.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 1206
          }
        ],
        "name": "Allegra Jacchia",
        "text": "We’re doubling down on video on 𝕏.\n\nToday, we're piloting Video Kickstart Bonus, an invite-only program that rewards creators for posting their video content here.  \n\nA few things to know:\n• Videos must be vertical, under 3 minutes, and content you’ve created yourself.\n• Videos you’ve already shared on other platforms are eligible, as long as they don’t have watermarks.\n• You must post at least 15 videos across 15 different days within the 30-day period of the campaign.\n\nInvites are rolling out over the next few days, and enrollment closes October 30. Happy posting!!",
